    "paragraph": "SeoulMMOD introduces an open benchmark dataset containing three years of hourly origin-destination flows across six transit modes in Seoul. A panel analysis of 626 Chinese provincial border counties reveals that improved cross-border high-speed rail network connectivity reduces PM2.5 levels. Additionally, spatial greening scenarios in Catania, Italy, were evaluated using thermal comfort simulations alongside dynamic human activity density estimates to measure climate regulation impact.",
